st weekly close since January as BTC price nears $79K</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 16:26:22 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 03 May 2026 16:26:22 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-preps-highest-weekly-close-since-january-as-btc-price-nears-79k</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-preps-highest-weekly-close-since-january-as-btc-price-nears-79k?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmNvaW50ZWxlZ3JhcGguY29tL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2hhdCUyMGFyZSUyMGNyeXB0b2N1cnJlbmN5JTIwbWFya2V0JTIwYml0Y29pbi0xLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin preps highest weekly close since January as BTC price nears $79K\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin canceled out the week's earlier losses to tease the highest BTC price weekly candle close since the end of January near $79,000.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by William Suberg</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmNvaW50ZWxlZ3JhcGguY29tL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2hhdCUyMGFyZSUyMGNyeXB0b2N1cnJlbmN5JTIwbWFya2V0JTIwYml0Y29pbi0xLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmNvaW50ZWxlZ3JhcGguY29tL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2hhdCUyMGFyZSUyMGNyeXB0b2N1cnJlbmN5JTIwbWFya2V0JTIwYml0Y29pbi0xLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Here’s what happened in crypto today</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 03 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL2FydGljbGUtY292ZXJzLTExMDU4OS13aGF0LWhhcHBlbmVkLWluLWNyeXB0by10b2RheS5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"Here’s what happened in crypto today\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Need to know what happened in crypto today? Here is the latest news on daily trends and events impacting Bitcoin price, blockchain, DeFi, NFTs, Web3 and crypto regulation.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Cointelegraph</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL2FydGljbGUtY292ZXJzLTExMDU4OS13aGF0LWhhcHBlbmVkLWluLWNyeXB0by10b2RheS5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL2FydGljbGUtY292ZXJzLTExMDU4OS13aGF0LWhhcHBlbmVkLWluLWNyeXB0by10b2RheS5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Trump memecoin</category>\n      <category>Solana memecoin</category>\n      <category>TRUMP token</category>\n      <category>Solana</category>\n      <category>SOL</category>\n      <category>Nova Labs</category>\n      <category>SEC</category>\n      <category>Securities and Exchange Commission</category>\n      <category>Crypto regulation</category>\n      <category>TRUMP rally</category>\n      <category>Bitcoin</category>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Americans distrust crypto, AI as industry super PACs flood midterms, poll finds</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 03 May 2026 13:00:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/americans-distrust-crypto-ai-as-industry-super-pacs-flood-midterms-poll-finds</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/americans-distrust-crypto-ai-as-industry-super-pacs-flood-midterms-poll-finds?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLU1vbmV5LW9yLUFzc2V0cy1Ib3ctRGlmZmVyZW50LUd2bnRzLURlZmluZS1DcnlwdG8uanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" alt=\"Americans distrust crypto, AI as industry super PACs flood midterms, poll finds\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>A new Politico poll finds most Americans distrust crypto and AI, raising questions about whether candidates backed by industry super PACs could face voter backlash.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLU1vbmV5LW9yLUFzc2V0cy1Ib3ctRGlmZmVyZW50LUd2bnRzLURlZmluZS1DcnlwdG8uanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLU1vbmV5LW9yLUFzc2V0cy1Ib3ctRGlmZmVyZW50LUd2bnRzLURlZmluZS1DcnlwdG8uanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Iran’s largest crypto exchange founded by sons of family tied to supreme leaders: Reuters</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 11:12:56 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 03 May 2026 11:12:56 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/irans-largest-crypto-exchange-founded-by-sons-of-family-tied-to-supreme-leaders-reuters</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/irans-largest-crypto-exchange-founded-by-sons-of-family-tied-to-supreme-leaders-reuters?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLUNyeXB0by1tYXJrZXQtdHJhZGluZy0xMzIzLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" alt=\"Iran’s largest crypto exchange founded by sons of family tied to supreme leaders: Reuters\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Nobitex, Iran’s largest crypto exchange, was founded by brothers linked to the powerful Kharrazi family, which has ties to the country’s supreme leaders. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLUNyeXB0by1tYXJrZXQtdHJhZGluZy0xMzIzLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLUNyeXB0by1tYXJrZXQtdHJhZGluZy0xMzIzLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>US CISA adds ‘insane’ Linux Copy Fail flaw to watch list</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 11:07:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 03 May 2026 11:07:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/linux-copy-fail-a-trivially-exploitable-bug</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/linux-copy-fail-a-trivially-exploitable-bug?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwQml0aHVtYiUyMEhhY2slMjAtJTIwd2hhdCUyMGlzJTIwa25vd24lMjAoMSkuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" alt=\"US CISA adds ‘insane’ Linux Copy Fail flaw to watch list\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Malicious actors with code execution capability may gain root access on Linux systems using as few as 10 lines of Python, according to a researcher.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Ciaran Lyons</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwQml0aHVtYiUyMEhhY2slMjAtJTIwd2hhdCUyMGlzJTIwa25vd24lMjAoMSkuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwQml0aHVtYiUyMEhhY2slMjAtJTIwd2hhdCUyMGlzJTIwa25vd24lMjAoMSkuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>New York forces Uphold to pay $5M over fraudulent crypto investment scheme</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 08:56:10 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 03 May 2026 08:56:10 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-york-forces-uphold-to-pay-5m-over-fraudulent-crypto-investment-scheme</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-york-forces-uphold-to-pay-5m-over-fraudulent-crypto-investment-scheme?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>[... 16528 more characters truncated]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779438734611}}
{"type":"message","id":"ec1039d5","parentId":"feaafff0","timestamp":"2026-05-22T08:32:14.612Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fzggtkLYQDjSLLhMSdJzIVbw","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 21:34:40 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>How Canton Network Lets Institutions Guard Against DeFi Security Risks: Digital Asset CEO</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366086/how-canton-network-lets-institutions-guard-against-defi-security-risks</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 20:20:00 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Because Canton allows participants to implement guardrails, Digital Asset&#39;s Yuval Rooz said institutions can protect against bad actors.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366086</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-wall-street-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>DeFi</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-wall-street-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>You Installed Hermes. Now Make It Look Better Than ChatGPT or Claude</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366535/you-installed-hermes-make-look-better-chatgpt-claude</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 19:55:35 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The terminal is fine. But if you actually want to live in your Hermes agent, here are the four best GUIs the community has built—and how to run them.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366535</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-hermes-green-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Long Reads</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-hermes-green-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI GPT Image 2 vs Google Nano Banana 2: Which AI Image Generator Is Best?</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366408/openai-gpt-image-2-vs-google-nano-banana-2-review</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 18:50:19 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Which state-of-the-art AI image generator is most effective at producing A+ results? We put GPT Image 2 and Nano Banana 2 to the test.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366408</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ChatGPT-Image-2-may-2026-12_39_28-p.m.-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ChatGPT-Image-2-may-2026-12_39_28-p.m.-gID_7.png\" height=\"941\" width=\"1672\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Oscars Ban AI Performances and Screenplays From Eligibility</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366405/oscars-ban-ai-performances-screenplays-eligibility</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 18:17:28 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>New rules require human actors and writers for Oscar consideration.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366405</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/tilly-norwood-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/tilly-norwood-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenClaw Put Apple Back in the AI Game—And Now They Can&#39;t Build Macs Fast Enough</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366389/openclaw-apple-mac-mini-shortage-ai-2026</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 13:01:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Mac mini went from a $599 desktop nobody cared about to the hottest piece of AI hardware on the planet. One open-source agent framework did it.</description>\n\n[1335 more lines in file. Use offset=221 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779438734611}}
