leave it to executive discretion.',\n    'The proposal would direct the Treasury Department to create and maintain a Bitcoin reserve for at least 20 years, while also establishing a separate Digital Asset Stockpile for federally held non-Bitcoin crypto assets.',\n    'Cross-referenced reporting says the reserve would consolidate crypto already held across federal agencies, much of it originating from seizures, forfeitures and penalties.',\n    'CoinTelegraph and CryptoSlate both reported the US currently holds about 328,372 BTC, worth roughly $25 billion to $25.5 billion, making it the largest nation-state Bitcoin holder.',\n    'The bill includes transparency measures such as public proof-of-reserve reporting, independent third-party audits and direct congressional oversight of the reserve.',\n    'Coverage also highlights a budget-neutral growth concept for the reserve, while explicitly protecting Americans’ lawful rights to own, transfer and self-custody digital assets.'\n  ],\n  'aggregated_raw_content': aggregated,\n  'tweet_quotes': []\n}\nout='/tmp/crypto-run-20260522-083045/research/raw.json'\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(out), exist_ok=True)\nwith open(out,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(payload,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\nprint(out)\nprint('WORDS', len(aggregated.split()))\nPY","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher","yieldMs":30000,"timeout":120,"security":"full","ask":"off"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":55050,"output":2187,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57237,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779438818579,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DiFc4U99LtZgk05ol2KS7tpnUzF7K"}}
